  /*DBGH*/if(TT)F.intro(M,'Titan','A Detourr original · 3D super-strength smash simulator','<p>You are <b>Titan</b>: the strongest thing on Earth, fast as a truck and twice as heavy, in a city where <b>every building is made of breakable blocks</b>.</p><p>Sprint straight through skyscrapers. Charge a leap and clear whole city blocks, then land hard enough to crater the street. Punch walls out, rip up cars to throw, run up the side of towers, and when the army shows up, get angry.</p>','WASD to run (S backs up), mouse to aim (click the game to lock the mouse). Shift sprints, and at full sprint you smash straight through buildings. Click punches. Hold Space to charge a jump and let go to leap, and the longer the charge, the further you fly. Run into a wall to climb it. Q ground pounds from the air. R throws a car. E goes into RAGE. G switches graphics quality. P pauses. On a phone: joystick, drag to look, and the on-screen buttons.');
  else if(KM)F.intro(M,'Kaiju Rampage','A Detourr original · 3D giant monster rampage','<p>You are a <b>30-metre atomic dinosaur</b>, and you have just woken up in the bay next to a city made entirely of <b>breakable blocks</b>.</p><p>Wade ashore and walk straight through skyscrapers: every block your body hits breaks loose and tumbles, and knocked-out floors bring the towers above crashing down. Swipe with your claws, spin your tail through whole buildings, stomp shockwaves through the streets, rip chunks off towers to throw, and charge your dorsal plates for a blazing <b>atomic breath</b>. The army fights back with tanks, attack choppers, missile trucks, fighter jets and gunboats. Then comes the <b>Mecha-Kaiju</b>.</p>','WASD to walk (S backs up), mouse to aim (click the game to lock the mouse). Shift runs. In deep water you swim, and swimming into a gunboat capsizes it. Click swipes your claws, and every third swipe in a row is a double-fist smash. Hold R or right-click to charge and fire atomic breath. Q tail whip. Space stomp. F roar (stuns the army and recharges energy). E grabs a car, a tank or a chunk of building, and click or E throws it. X fires an atomic pulse at 70% energy. G switches graphics quality. P pauses. On a phone: joystick, drag to look, and the on-screen buttons.');
  else if(VM)F.intro(M,'Overlord','A Detourr original · 3D villain rampage','<p>Pick your villain and bring the city to its knees, in the same <b>fully destructible block city</b> as Havoc Unleashed: every wall chips, every floor can be blown out and whole towers collapse onto their neighbours.</p><p><b>Overlord</b> slices towers with laser eyes. <b>Ruin</b> is a giant green brute who punches through walls, leaps whole blocks and throws cars. <b>Havoc</b> brings every gun. <b>Tempest</b> chains lightning and summons tornadoes. <b>Pyra</b> melts walls with fire and calls down meteors.</p>','WASD to move (<b>S</b> flies backwards), mouse to aim (click the game to lock the mouse). <b>Hold click</b> for your main attack, <b>R</b> for your power, <b>Q</b> to sky slam. <b>Space</b> flies up, <b>Z or Ctrl</b> down, <b>Shift</b> boosts. Ruin: hold Space to leap, run into walls to climb, Shift for RAGE. Havoc: 1–6 switch guns. G switches graphics quality. P pauses. On a phone: joystick, drag to look, and the on-screen buttons.');
